<title>INDIA: Indian Nov industrial output up 4.0 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Indian Nov industrial output up 4.0 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's index of industrial production increased by 4.0 percent in November 1996 over the same month in 1995, the government said on Friday.</p>
<p>    INDUSTRIAL PRODUCTION     Nov 96    Oct 96    Nov 95</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change	  +4.0     +10.0     +11.9</p>
<p>     -Mining			 +7.1	+6.2	+3.1</p>
<p>     -Manufacturing		+3.2     +11.1     +14.2</p>
<p>     -Electricity		  +5.8	+6.9	+6.9</p>
<p>    Index (base 100=1980/81)  296.9     301.2     285.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures for November 1996 are preliminary. Figures for October 1996 have been revised.  </p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    CUMULATIVE			 Apr-Nov 96    Apr-Nov 95</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change		+9.1	    +11.7</p>
<p>     -Mining			     +2.5	     +8.9</p>
<p>     -Manufacturing		   +11.0	    +12.4</p>
<p>     -Electricity			+3.7	     +9.7</p>
<p>     Index (base 100=1980/81)     292.1	    267.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures for November 1996 are preliminary.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
